# VGMPLAY.WMF (Wild Commander plugin, v0.9.03-beta) playing a YM2203 VGM, then a generated SAA1099 VGM
describe Real-program trace (CL-2): Wild Commander 1.11 RC7 + VGMPLAY.WMF on TS-Conf (14 MHz) with the card in a slot;
describe music/vgm/ym2203/01 (YM2203 @ 3.99 MHz, Kara no Naka no Kotori, PC-98) for about 3 s, then
describe music/vgm/saa/saa-tones.vgm (generated, SAA1099) for about 3 s
describe ts-conf config with zxbus.1 = multisound; SD card wc/wc-multisound.img; PC keys in Wild Commander
machine ts-conf
cpu 14
sd wc/wc-multisound.img
reset
frames 400
key pc.enter 3
frames 30
key pc.down 2
key pc.down 2
key pc.down 2
key pc.down 2
key pc.down 2
key pc.enter 3
frames 30
key pc.down 2
key pc.down 2
key pc.down 2
key pc.enter 3
frames 30
key pc.down 2
key pc.enter 3
frames 150
key pc.esc 3
frames 30
key pc.home 2
key pc.enter 3
frames 30
screen
key pc.up 2
key pc.enter 3
frames 30
key pc.down 2
key pc.down 2
key pc.down 2
key pc.enter 3
frames 150
screen
save wc-vgmplay
